.242" end="00:52.491">dle</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">DJ 一落针放歌 他们就彻底陷入疯狂</span></p><p begin="00:53.575" end="00:56.008" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L13"><span begin="00:53.575" end="00:53.765">Get</span><span begin="00:53.765" end="00:53.955">tin'</span> <span begin="00:53.955" end="00:54.375">so</span> <span begin="00:54.375" end="00:54.549">gone,</span> <span begin="00:54.549" end="00:54.763">I'm</span> <span begin="00:54.763" end="00:55.246">not</span> <span begin="00:55.246" end="00:55.545">blin</span><span begin="00:55.545" end="00:56.008">kin'</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">嗨到忘乎所以 连眼都不眨一下</span></p><p begin="00:56.802" end="00:59.314" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L14"><span begin="00:56.802" end="00:56.991">What</span> <span begin="00:56.991" end="00:57.396">in</span> <span begin="00:57.396" end="00:57.598">the</span> <span begin="00:57.598" end="00:57.842">world</span> <span begin="00:57.842" end="00:58.050">was</span> <span begin="00:58.050" end="00:58.473">I</span> <span begin="00:58.473" end="00:58.858">thin</span><span begin="00:58.858" end="00:59.314">kin'?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我当时到底在想些什么？</span></p><p begin="00:59.895" end="01:02.663" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L15"><span begin="00:59.895" end="01:00.168">New</span> <span begin="01:00.168" end="01:00.749">day,</span> <span begin="01:00.749" end="01:00.946">new</span> <span begin="01:00.946" end="01:01.134">mo</span><span begin="01:01.134" end="01:01.393">ney</span> <span begin="01:01.393" end="01:01.619">to</span> <span begin="01:01.619" end="01:01.845">be</span> <span begin="01:01.845" end="01:02.663">made</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">新的一天 又有大笔新的钞票等着要赚</span></p><p begin="01:03.402" end="01:05.975" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L16"><span begin="01:03.402" end="01:03.597">There</span> <span begin="01:03.597" end="01:04.165">is</span> <span begin="01:04.165" end="01:04.393">no</span><span begin="01:04.39